<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6764489679"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:55.940"><div begin="13.077" end="37.110" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.077" end="17.286" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.077" end="13.688">从</span><span begin="13.688" end="14.364">不</span><span begin="14.364" end="14.872">主</span><span begin="14.872" end="15.544">动</span><span begin="15.544" end="16.038">示</span><span begin="16.038" end="17.286">弱</span></p><p begin="17.813" end="23.967" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.813" end="18.047">我</span><span begin="18.047" end="18.426">们</span><span begin="18.426" end="18.759">的</span><span begin="18.759" end="19.190">过</span><span begin="19.190" end="19.570">去</span> <span begin="19.570" end="20.017">分</span><span begin="20.017" end="20.589">分</span><span begin="20.802" end="21.191">合</span><span begin="21.191" end="21.956">合</span><span begin="21.956" end="22.428">太</span><span begin="22.428" end="23.967">多</span></p><p begin="24.111" end="30.228" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.111" end="24.421">伤</span><span begin="24.421" end="24.788">人</span><span begin="24.788" end="24.938">的</span><span begin="24.938" end="25.800">话难</span><span begin="25.800" end="27.102">说</span> <span begin="27.366" end="27.557">却</span><span begin="27.557" end="28.125">觉得</span><span begin="28.125" end="29.014">很洒</span><span begin="29.014" end="30.228">脱</span></p><p begin="30.572" end="37.110" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.572" end="30.794">曾</span><span begin="30.794" end="32.802">经的那些发</span><span begin="32.802" end="33.091">生</span><span begin="33.091" end="33.653">过</span><span begin="33.653" end="33.853">的</span><span begin="33.853" end="34.381">开</span><span begin="34.381" end="34.654">心</span><span begin="34.654" end="35.093">和</span><span begin="35.093" end="35.666">难</span><span begin="35.666" end="37.110">过</span></p></div><div begin="37.120" end="1:04.203" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="37.120" end="42.672" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.120" end="37.964">就</span><span begin="37.964" end="38.968">像</span><span begin="39.572" end="40.130">开败的</span><span begin="40.130" end="40.857">花</span> <span begin="40.857" end="41.758">浪也拍打着</span><span begin="41.758" end="42.672">沙</span></p><p begin="42.822" end="45.839" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.822" end="43.441">我却对</span><span begin="43.441" end="43.946">你</span><span begin="43.946" end="44.259">情</span><span begin="44.259" end="44.822">有</span><span begin="44.822" end="45.021">独</span><span begin="45.021" end="45.839">钟</span></p><p begin="45.906" end="49.174" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.906" end="46.588">我陪你留</span><span begin="46.588" end="47.187">下</span> <span begin="47.187" end="48.178">说最浪漫的</span><span begin="48.178" end="49.174">话</span></p><p begin="49.184" end="52.383" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.184" end="49.797">即便是</span><span begin="49.797" end="50.705">青春</span><span begin="50.705" end="51.243">的</span><span begin="51.243" end="51.486">懵</span><span begin="51.486" end="52.383">懂</span></p><p begin="52.393" end="54.247" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.393" end="53.187">但是我们</span><span begin="53.187" end="53.857">渐行渐</span><span begin="53.857" end="54.247">远</span></p><p begin="54.408" end="56.867" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.408" end="55.362">逐渐戴上现</span><span begin="55.362" end="56.005">实</span><span begin="56.005" end="56.181">的</span><span begin="56.181" end="56.502">枷</span><span begin="56.502" end="56.867">锁</span></p><p begin="57.070" end="1:04.203" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.070" end="57.431">信任</span><span begin="57.431" end="58.052">在</span><span begin="58.052" end="1:00.022">短短解释后</span><span begin="1:00.022" end="1:00.576">崩</span><span begin="1:00.781" end="1:04.203">塌</span></p></div><div begin="1:04.399" end="1:26.259" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:04.399" end="1:11.226" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.399" end="1:05.299">我</span><span begin="1:05.610" end="1:06.486">不知</span><span begin="1:06.486" end="1:07.242">为</span><span begin="1:07.242" end="1:08.539">何</span> <span begin="1:08.943" end="1:09.225">疯</span><span begin="1:09.225" end="1:09.640">狂</span><span begin="1:09.640" end="1:10.574">对你执</span><span begin="1:10.574" end="1:11.226">着</span></p><p begin="1:11.236" end="1:15.102" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.236" end="1:11.474">我</span><span begin="1:11.474" end="1:12.007">们</span><span begin="1:12.007" end="1:12.255">之</span><span begin="1:12.255" end="1:12.803">间</span><span begin="1:12.803" end="1:13.071">的</span><span begin="1:13.071" end="1:13.580">故</span><span begin="1:13.580" end="1:14.054">事还</span><span begin="1:14.054" end="1:14.462">不</span><span begin="1:14.462" end="1:15.102">多</span></p><p begin="1:15.422" end="1:21.215" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.422" end="1:15.627">这</span><span begin="1:15.627" end="1:16.538">回忆的</span><span begin="1:16.538" end="1:17.134">漩</span><span begin="1:17.134" end="1:18.059">涡</span> <span begin="1:18.372" end="1:18.837">快要</span><span begin="1:18.837" end="1:20.041">把我吞</span><span begin="1:20.041" end="1:21.215">没</span></p><p begin="1:21.571" end="1:26.259" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.571" end="1:22.038">求你</span><span begin="1:22.038" end="1:23.337">别离开</span><span begin="1:23.337" end="1:26.259">我</span></p></div><div begin="1:28.406" end="1:51.301" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:28.406" end="1:33.868" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.406" end="1:30.034">因为</span><span begin="1:30.034" end="1:31.040">我</span> <span begin="1:31.552" end="1:32.872">欠你太</span><span begin="1:32.872" end="1:33.868">多</span></p><p begin="1:34.570" end="1:40.603" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.570" end="1:34.769">手</span><span begin="1